  "releaseNotes": "Features\n- Ship a working update button and harden the update manager (#4)\n- Wire the file manager end to end -- agent channel, client, two-pane UI\n- Rc-file-transfer -- safe paths, honest listings, verified transfers\n- Monitoring and Terminal screens, backed by real readings and real PTYs\n- Real PTY sessions and measured system metrics\n- Real connect, disconnect and reconnect; fix certificate instability\n- Bind the listener, serve sessions, and open pairing windows in-process\n- QUIC pairing over the wire, mDNS discovery, per-connection identity\n- Secure pairing, device identity and trusted devices\n\nFixes\n- Name assets as GitHub will serve them\n- Omit unset minimum-version fields instead of emitting \"\"\n- Read release signing keys as blank-tolerant\n- Cross-compile the Intel macOS build instead of using macos-13\n- Find bundles in the workspace target directory\n",
